    {
      "id": "inazuma",
      "name": "Inazuma",
      "type": "location",
      "base_description": "A nation ruled by the Electro Archon, known for enforcing isolation and the Vision Hunt Decree. The will of Inazuma’s people is embodied in their Visions. It is a place where The Traveler arrives causing widespread unrest and resistance, meets allies like Ayaka and Thoma, and engages in conflict with the Shogunate. A resistance led by Sangonomiya Kokomi exists, and the Fatui secretly manipulate events to destabilize Inazuma further. The true Archon Raiden Ei has retreated into the Plane of Euthymia, leaving a puppet Shogun to enforce her ideals. Events occur involving The Traveler and the Raiden Shogun, where she abandons the Vision Hunt Decree, restores the Visions, ends the civil conflict, and begins guiding Inazuma toward a new future. The Traveler arrives in Inazuma and interacts with its ruler, the Shogun.",
      "base_attributes": {},
